  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **intro (open doors)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **self-conscious**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **King of Prussia**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **In Corolla (Peter on guitar)**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **intro (two-headed boy)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 14 archived performances [2]\n- **Pet Politics (Silver Jews)**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Song for Lonely Giants, Maybe Sprout Wings [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2006-09-20.flacf** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 64 min [1]. Said about its sound: Clipping is present, particularly on the bass, despite the low input volume setting [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The recorder was positioned right next to the left speaker, with no board access [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2006-09-20.flacf**: taped by drworm01; transferred by drworm01; source: MAudio stereo electret mic -> MAudio MicroTrack 24/96 (16 @ 44.1) [1]. Also: Recorded with the MicroTrack's included microphone, not the built-in mic, by a first-time user [1]",
